#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0149B expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "AVAL is NOT declared. Requirements.Variables.All names AVAL, so the rule skips. Deliberately drops the KEY column (AD0149's skip fixture drops the TARGET), so the pair covers both halves of the All list. PARAMCD still detects BASIC DATA STRUCTURE without AVAL, so the skip is attributable to Requirements.Variables and not to the structure gate."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVALC   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | LOW
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | GLUC | HIGH
